			<item>The consoles that draw it: <link target="src-packages-app-src-runner-runnerconsole-tsx" link="/src/app/runner/RunnerConsole.tsx"><text title="src/app/runner/RunnerConsole.tsx" code>RunnerConsole.tsx</></>, <link target="src-packages-app-src-solid-consoleviewer-tsx" link="/src/app/solid/ConsoleViewer.tsx"><text title="src/app/solid/ConsoleViewer.tsx" code>ConsoleViewer.tsx</></></>
		</>
